# Example authorized_keys for WDMCH rescue SSH
# Copy your PUBLIC key here (not private key!)
#
# Format: ssh-rsa AAAA... your@email
#
# DO NOT include private key material in this file.
# The actual authorized_keys is populated at build time
# from the WDMCH_SSH_AUTHORIZED_KEY secret.
#
# This file is an EXAMPLE only.
# It is NOT the actual authorized_keys used by the system.
# Do NOT commit actual SSH keys to this repository.

# ssh-rsa AAAAB3NzaC1yc2E... example-key@email
